{title: Rote Hue Aaate Hain Sab}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Kalyanji Anandji}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]rote hue aate hain sub
[F]hansataa [E]hua [Am]jo jaaegaa
[G]vo muqaddar [F]kaa sikandar
[G]jaaneman [F]kahalaaegaa [G] [Am]
[G]vo sikandar kyaa thaa jisane
[G]zulm [F]se [Am]jiitaa jahaan
[G]pyaar se jeete jo dilon ko
[G]vo [F]jhukaa [Am]de aasamaan
[D]jo sitaaron par kahaani
[F]pyaar ki [E]likh jaaegaa
[G]vo muqaddar [F]kaa sikandar
[G]jaaneman [F]kahalaaegaa [G] [Am]
[E]zindagi to [Am]bevafaa hai
[F]ek [E]din thukaraaegi
[E]maut mahabubaa [Am]hai apne
[F]saath [E]lekar jaaegi
[G]mar ke jeene ki adaa jo
[F]duniyaa [E]ko sikhalaaegaa
[G]vo muqaddar [F]kaa sikandar
[G]jaaneman [F]kahalaaegaa [G] [Am]
